---
---

{/* ponytail: placeholder copy, swap in real content */}
<section class="whatido fixed inset-0 h-screen w-screen" id="whatido-section" data-stack>
  <div class="whatido__inner">
    <h2 class="whatido__title">O que eu faço</h2>
    <p class="whatido__text">
      Construo interfaces com atenção a <em>detalhe</em> e movimento,
      unindo código e animação para criar experiências que respondem
      ao usuário.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="whatido__bar" id="whatido-bar" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</section>

<style>
  .whatido {
    background: #fff;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    clip-path: inset(0% 0% 0% 0%);
    will-change: clip-path;
  }

  /* ponytail: width must match FINAL_WIDTH_VW in src/lib/sectionStack.ts —
     same rectangle the hero's mask shrinks down to, ready to animate next */
  .whatido__bar {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 50%;
    width: 5vw;
    height: 100%;
    background: #000;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  .whatido__inner {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 8vh 5vw;
  }

  .whatido__title {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    color: #111;
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .whatido__text {
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin: 0;
    color: #374151;
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.25rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .whatido__text em {
    font-family: "Cormorant Infant", serif;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #111;
  }
</style>
